xt":"Metering runs before and after each model call. The loop assembles context, emits notices, walks fallback choices, streams text and tool calls, polls cancellation during silence, and closes the adapter stream.","title":"Model calls and streaming"},{"anchor":"    def _plan_calls","lines":"1030-1221","text":"Model calls receive fresh ids and are rejected for malformed input, missing visibility, unavailable tools, or schema errors. Valid calls run concurrently through the broker; results are flushed in call order and feed failure accounting.","title":"Tool planning and execution"},{"anchor":"    async def _cancel_reason","lines":"1225-1444","text":"Cancellation watches the shared guard and cancels broker work. State helpers send notices and errors, pause or end infrastructure failures, close streams, build the process-wide loop, and register it with run handlers.","title":"Cancellation, pausing, and installation"}],"commit":"3727ae323c26919558a3b5f6db73c81a578537fb","concepts":["model fallback chain","tool visibility","approval state","plan mode","failure breaker","dangling calls","bounded cancellation"],"gotchas":["The loop never marks a run completed; callers decide whether another turn continues.","Tool arguments and result text are bounded or replaced by fixed server-authored messages in several error paths.","Provider secrets are represented only by environment-variable names in model choices."],"how_it_works":["Builds a catalog of visible and schema-valid tools","Streams a model reply and classifies its tool calls","Runs approved calls concurrently while preserving conversation order","Pauses, resumes, cancels, or finishes according to outcomes"],"inputs":["run and conversation records","model choices","adapter","tool broker","run stores","metering","tool calls","cancel and approval signals"],"layer":"codeagent","outputs":["TurnResult","run events","conversation messages","tool proposals"],"path":"backend/codeagent/loop.py","purpose":"AgentLoop assembles con